cumentation</h3><p>Plans, sections, elevations and schedules produced live from the model.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>04</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">QA/QC</h3><p>Run model health, standards and clash checks before issue.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>05</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Issue</h3><p>Drawing sets issued to your standard and the relevant authority submission rules.</p></div></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap pn\">\n  <a href=\"/bim-services/scan-to-bim/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-scan.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Surveyor using a total station on a construction site\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-scan.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-scan-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-scan-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-scan-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-scan-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"lab\">Previous service</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Scan-to-BIM</h2></a>\n  <a href=\"/bim-services/structural-bim/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1279\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-struct.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Steel structural frame against the sky\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-struct.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-struct-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-struct-1024x682.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-struct-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-struct-1536x1023.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"lab\">Next service</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Structural BIM</h2></a>\n</div></section>\n","cta":"<img class=\"bg\" srcset=\"/assets/img/dxb-night-960.jpg 960w